# Trim the build context. The Containerfile only reads the sources,
# `Cargo.toml`, `Cargo.lock` and the committed `.sqlx/` cache, so
# everything else is wasted bytes that podman has to scan and tar.
# Same exclusions `.gitignore` carries, plus a few build-only paths
# that the spec for this file calls out by name.

# Build output. `cargo build` re-creates it inside the builder stage.
target/
# The fuzz crate is a separate workspace; its build is driven by
# `cargo fuzz` and its `target/` is not a build input.
fuzz/target/
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/
# Git metadata. Never part of a build context.
.git/
# Generated SBOMs and notices from the supply-chain workflow.
*.cdx.json
NOTICES.html
# Research notes kept locally. Never committed and never built.
research/
# Local virtualenv from the signing step (release.yml).
.venv/
# Agent / tool artifacts that should never reach a registry.
.claude/
.agents/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/
.playwright-mcp/
**/*-mcp/
# cargo-mutants output.
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/
